description	"Ninja Archer

^2Weaponry:
- Ninjato
-- ^5Cyan ^7Style Only
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)
- Bow & Arrow

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (2)

^3Abilities:
- Camoflage [Cloak 2]
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

The bow and arrow was an integral tool in the ninja's arsenal. Ninja would often hide in foliage or among the trees to take out their enemies from afar."